# - resource -------------------------------------------------------------------

<https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CapabilityStatement/FHIR4EyesCapabilityStatement> a fhir:CapabilityStatement ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "FHIR4EyesCapabilityStatement"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement FHIR4EyesCapabilityStatement</b></p><a name=\"FHIR4EyesCapabilityStatement\"> </a><a name=\"hcFHIR4EyesCapabilityStatement\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">FHIR4Eyes Server Capability Statement</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 0.3.0 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>json</code>, <code>xml</code></li><li>Published on: 2026-09-01 </li><li>Published by: FHIR4Eyes Project </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>A conformant FHIR4Eyes server SHALL support read, search-type, create and update interactions for the resource types and profiles listed below, and SHALL support the listed search parameters at a minimum.</p>\n</div></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Patient1-1\">Patient</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-patient.html\">Ophthalmic Patient</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>identifier, name, birthdate</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Encounter1-2\">Encounter</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-encounter.html\">Ophthalmic Encounter</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, date, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Observation1-3\">Observation</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-visual-acuity.html\">Ophthalmic Visual Acuity</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-intraocular-pressure.html\">Intraocular Pressure</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-corrected-intraocular-pressure.html\">Corrected Intraocular Pressure</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-pachymetry.html\">Pachymetry</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-tension-curve.html\">Tension Curve</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-oct-macula.html\">Ophthalmic OCT Macula</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-oct-rnfl.html\">Ophthalmic OCT RNFL</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-humphrey-visual-field.html\">Ophthalmic Humphrey Visual Field</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-specular-microscopy.html\">Ophthalmic Specular Microscopy</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-ocular-biometry.html\">Ophthalmic Ocular Biometry</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-iol-formula-result.html\">IOL Formula Result</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-anterior-surface.html\">Corneal Tomography - Anterior Surface</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-posterior-surface.html\">Corneal Tomography - Posterior Surface</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-pachymetry.html\">Corneal Tomography - Pachymetry</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-anterior-chamber.html\">Corneal Tomography - Anterior Chamber</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-keratoconus-indices.html\">Corneal Tomography - Keratoconus Indices</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ct-densitometry.html\">Corneal Tomography - Densitometry</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-strabismus-exam.html\">Strabismus Exam</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-cover-test.html\">Cover Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ocular-motility.html\">Ocular Motility</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-near-point-of-convergence.html\">Near Point of Convergence</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-convergence-assessment.html\">Convergence Assessment</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-prism-cover-test.html\">Prism Cover Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-krimsky-test.html\">Krimsky Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-hirschberg-test.html\">Hirschberg Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-red-filter-light-test.html\">Red Filter Light Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-worth-4-dot-test.html\">Worth 4 Dot Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-stereopsis-test.html\">Stereopsis Test</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-gaze-position-measurement.html\">Gaze Position Measurement</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, date, code, category, encounter, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Condition1-4\">Condition</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-condition.html\">Ophthalmic Condition</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, code, encounter, clinical-status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Procedure1-5\">Procedure</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-procedure.html\">Ophthalmic Procedure</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, date, code, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ServiceRequest1-6\">ServiceRequest</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-service-request.html\">Ophthalmic Service Request</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, code, encounter, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#DiagnosticReport1-7\">DiagnosticReport</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-diagnostic-report.html\">Ophthalmic Diagnostic Report</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-corneal-tomography-report.html\">Corneal Tomography Report</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, date, code, category, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ImagingStudy1-8\">ImagingStudy</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-imaging-study.html\">Ophthalmic Imaging Study</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, started, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#MedicationAdministration1-9\">MedicationAdministration</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-medication-administration.html\">Ophthalmic Medication Administration</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, code, encounter, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Medication1-10\">Medication</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-medication.html\">Ophthalmic Medication</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>code, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#CarePlan1-11\">CarePlan</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-care-plan.html\">Ophthalmic Care Plan</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, category, date, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Device1-12\">Device</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-device.html\">Ophthalmic Device</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, type, status</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#BodyStructure1-13\">BodyStructure</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ocular-body-structure.html\">Ocular Body Structure</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, morphology</td><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Patient1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Patient</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Core FHIR Resource</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/patient.html\">Patient</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-patient.html\">Ophthalmic Patient</a></p></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Documentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Patient demographics with Chilean RUT and passport identifier slices.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><